      "writtenOn": "2015-04-28T00:03:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "can you express this more roundabout, eg.\n\n type criticalOptionValue struct {\n    V string\n }\n\n type criticalOption struct {\n   K string\n   V []byte\n }\n\n  ..\n\n  Marshal(criticalOption{key, Marshal(criticalOptionValue{opt[key]}))\n\n\nand then use the same structures for unmarshaling?",
      "revId": "3d1897b2e360065eec7489836712ae27b75dad90",
      "serverId": "62eb7196-b449-3ce5-99f1-c037f21e1705",
