      "writtenOn": "2015-04-28T18:20:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "you have a very good point.  I left it for the Extensions and because it worked - but re-reading [PROTOCOL.certkeys] I notice that the Critical Options and Extensions are supposed to have the same format, it\u0027s just that the current extensions have all empty values.  I reverted the names to parseTuples / marshalTuples to cover both critical options and extensions, and made those functions to cover both type of option fields.",
